From 7b6a1c47d9da0dd9134a7552a4b4a55f895f2ab5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jeff <jridder@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:47:06 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Port from Granite to libadwaita

- Adw.Application replaces Granite.init/Granite.Settings dark-mode handling
- SaveDialog is now an Adw.Window with Adw.ToolbarView, EntryRow, ComboRow, ActionRow
- Gtk.FileChooserNative -> Gtk.FileDialog, Gtk.ComboBoxText -> Adw.ComboRow
- Granite.MessageDialog -> Adw.Window + Adw.StatusPage error dialog
- Fall back to ~/Pictures when XDG Pictures dir is unset

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011CoAKAmHz1EJYJVJko4uXZ
